# Project structure

Standard **Vite + React** layout at `apex-frontend/` root:

```
src/           Application source (@/ alias)
public/        Static files served as /
index.html     Vite HTML entry
vite.config.ts Dev :8080, build → dist/, /api proxy
```

## Path alias

- `@/*` → `src/*` (see `tsconfig.json` and `vite.config.ts`)
- Example: `import AppLayout from "@/components/AppLayout"`

## `src/` breakdown

- **`main.tsx`** — boots React, imports `global.css`
- **`App.tsx`** — providers, product `AppShell` + `AppLayout` routes, Admin sibling routes
- **`pages/`** — route components; `HomeRoute` switches `Dashboard` vs `PublicHome`; `pages/admin/` for Admin
- **`components/`** — shared UI (`AppLayout`, `HubTopBar`, `BottomNav`, `dashboard/*`, `profile/*`, `app-ui/*`, `ui/*`)
- **`components/app-ui/`** — product theme primitives (AppDialog, AppSwitch, button/modal class helpers)
- **`components/ui/`** — shadcn primitives (Admin + shared)
- **`styles/theme.css`** — product `.apex-theme` / `--apex-*` tokens (imported by `AppLayout`)
- **`global.css`** — shadcn/Admin semantic tokens
- **`features/`** — optional modules for complex flows (settings, session detail, manual activity)
- **`lib/`** — `api/` (HTTP client), `validation/`, helpers
- **`auth/`** — route guards only (login forms live under `pages/`)
- **`contexts/`** — `AuthContext`
- **`config/`** — `navigation.ts` (nav source of truth)

There is **no** `pages/v2/`, `components/v2/`, or `Header.tsx` product shell. Product URLs are unprefixed only — do not scaffold `/v2` routes or legacy path aliases.

## API layer

- All HTTP to backend: **`src/lib/api/`**
- Add endpoints in domain files; export from `src/lib/api/index.ts` when shared
- Never import from deleted `shared/` or `server/` paths

## Config files (root)

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `tailwind.config.ts` | Scans `./index.html`, `./src/**/*`; includes product `apex.*` colors/fonts/radius |
| `eslint.config.js` | `src/**` = browser; `vite.config.ts` = node |
| `components.json` | shadcn paths → `src/global.css`, `@/components` |
| `vercel.json` | SPA hosting |

## Monorepo context

- Backend: sibling **`apex`** (Fastify, port 10000 default)
- This package: frontend only; no `DATABASE_URL` or Prisma here
